# Firebase — see Docs/FIREBASE_SETUP.md
#
# The service account is a CREDENTIAL: anyone holding it can send push
# notifications to every BizIQ user. google-services.json is not secret in the
# same way, but it identifies one particular Firebase project and belongs to
# whoever set that project up rather than to the code.
frontend/google-services.json
backend/firebase-service-account.json
